        "documentsRequired_md": "\n1. Agreement 1 - Agreement Deed between fish kiosk owner and Fisheries Department.\n1. Date of Birth Certificate (Voting Card/Birth Certificate/Aadhar Card/Matriculation Certificate).\n1. Caste Certificate (from first class Magistrate/Tehsildar).\n1. Training Certificate of Beneficiary.\n1. Land Record (from Tehsil - Own Land-Jamabandi, Nakal Akshizra Farad, or Registered Lease Deed).\n1. Bills/Receipts/Vouchers.\n1. Photographs of the Fish Kiosk with Beneficiary.\n1. Details of Bank Account and PAN Card.\n1. Detailed Project Report (DPR)/Self Contained Proposal (SCP) as per Pradhan Mantri Matasya Sampada Yojana (PMMSY) guidelines.\n\n",
